course: dictionary
lesson: 5036
title: What is an injector?
level: primary-6
stars: 0
explain: An injector is a device that pushes a liquid or gas into something. The clues are in the word's job: it puts something in.
explain: «An adrenaline auto-injector can save the life of someone having a severe allergic reaction, so know where your friend keeps it.» Here the auto-injector is a pen-like injector that pushes medicine through the skin. Because it can save a life, it is important to know where it is.
explain: «An adrenaline auto-injector opens the airways and raises blood pressure fast; it is pressed firmly into the outer thigh, even through clothes, and 999 is called because the reaction can come back.» The words pressed, thigh and 999 show what to do in an emergency. Trained adults use it, and a grown-up must always be called straight away.
fact: An injector is a device that pushes a liquid or gas into something.
fact: A fuel injector pushes fuel into a car engine.
fact: An auto-injector is a pen-like device that pushes medicine through the skin.
fact: An adrenaline auto-injector, sometimes called an EpiPen, is used for severe allergies such as nut allergies or bee stings.
fact: In an emergency, adults are trained to use an auto-injector, and 999 is called.
exercise: «An adrenaline auto-injector can save the life of someone having a severe allergic reaction.» What is an auto-injector? | A small bag for school books | A kind of hat for keeping warm | *A pen-like device that pushes medicine through the skin | A type of bicycle lock
exercise: In a car, what does a fuel injector do? | *Pushes fuel into the engine | Keeps the windows clean | Lights up the dashboard | Blows warm air into the cabin
exercise: «It is pressed firmly into the outer thigh, even through clothes.» Which part of the body is it pressed into? | arm | *thigh | head | hand
test: Why should you know where your friend keeps an auto-injector? | It tells the time | *Someone with a severe allergy may need it quickly | It is a kind of fuel for cars | It is a toy to play with at break
test: In an emergency, who should be called after an auto-injector is used? | Your teacher only | The bus company | A taxi | *999
exam: Which sentence best explains what an injector does? | An injector stops rain from falling | *An injector pushes a liquid or gas into something | An injector is a type of fish | An injector is a kind of school bag
